OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,C'Mummy's death was preventable, she    
OL,5,Cwas robbed of her future'              
OL,6,GA woman whose death after surgery was  
OL,7,Gruled preventable was "robbed of her   
OL,8,Gfuture," her daughter has said.        
OL,10,FLillian Diamond was 60 years old when  
OL,11,Fshe underwent an elective splenectomy  
OL,12,Fsurgery at the Mater Hospital in       
OL,13,FBelfast in 2019.                       
OL,15,FShe died weeks later after going into  
OL,16,Fcardiac arrest. It was found she was   
OL,17,Falso suffering from infection, portal  
OL,18,Fvein thrombosis and pulmonary embolism.
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
