OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CMan to serve two years in jail over    
OL,5,CBallymena riots                        
OL,6,GA man who threw missiles including     
OL,7,Gmasonry, bottles and a tin of paint at 
OL,8,Gpolice has been jailed for two years.  
OL,10,FAdam Tweed, 21, of Dalriada Walk in    
OL,11,FBallymena, was described in court as   
OL,12,Fan "active and persistent" participant 
OL,13,Fin rioting in the town in the summer   
OL,14,Fof 2025.                               
OL,16,FHe previously pleaded guilty to one    
OL,17,Fcharge of riot and one charge of       
OL,18,Fattempting to damage a police vehicle. 
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
