OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CMan arrested after Sean Graham         
OL,5,Cbookmakers memorial vandalised again   
OL,6,GAn 18-year-old man has been arrested   
OL,7,Gafter a memorial to those killed in    
OL,8,Gthe Sean Graham bookmakers attack was  
OL,9,Gvandalised for the third time in as    
OL,10,Gmany months.                           
OL,12,FFive people were murdered in the       
OL,13,FUlster Defence Association (UDA)       
OL,14,Fattack on the Ormeau Road in south     
OL,15,FBelfast in 1992. Seven other people    
OL,16,Fwere injured.                          
OL,18,FPaint was thrown over a plaque         
OL,19,Fdedicated to the victims in the early  
OL,20,Fhours of Friday morning. Police are    
OL,21,Ftreating the attack as a "sectarian-   
OL,22,Fmotivated hate crime".            G4/4 
